    cfgeventspawns.xml — Realistic Vehicle Overhaul
    ==================================================
    Fixed spawn coordinates for all vehicle events defined in events.xml.

    INSTALL PATH: mpmissions/dayzOffline.chernarusplus/db/cfgeventspawns.xml

    FORMAT: <pos x="..." z="..." a="..."/>
      x = east-west coordinate (DayZ world space)
      z = north-south coordinate (DayZ world space)
      a = vehicle heading in degrees (0 = north, 90 = east, 180 = south, 270 = west)

    COORDINATE COVERAGE:
    Spawn points are spread across the entire Chernarus+ map including:
      - Major coastal cities: Elektrozavodsk, Chernomorsk, Berezino, Svetlojarsk
      - Inland towns: Novo Sobor, Guglovo, Mogilevka, Gvozdno, Vybor, Pustoshka
      - Villages throughout the map
      - Highway/road positions along the coast road and north highway
      - Gas station locations at major towns
      - Industrial sites: ports, factories, sawmills, quarry
      - Rural farm areas throughout
      - Police station and checkpoint locations

    TOTAL SPAWN POSITIONS: ~105 spread across 7 event types
      VehicleCivilianParking    22 positions
      VehicleRoadsideBreakdown  18 positions
      VehicleGasStation         14 positions
      VehicleIndustrial         12 positions
      VehiclePoliceCheckpoint    9 positions
      VehicleRuralFarm          16 positions
      VehicleHighway            14 positions
-->
